    1:1 port of the web derive block: totalMeters = lifetime_km*1000; dailyAvgMeters = (last_30d_km/30)*1000;
    display = convertDistanceFromSI(meters, unit) [km/1000, mi/1609.344, ft/0.3048]; milestone =
